### OpenGL goes through zink onto Turnip rather than freedreno's own GL
### driver: the Vulkan path is the one that gets the work. This was a
### link to the SM8750 quirk, dangling since that platform was removed,
### so only devices that ran the old copy still had it.
cat <<EOF >/storage/.config/profile.d/095-force_zink
MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE="zink"
EOF
